"{\"url\":\"https://www.microcision.com/copy-of-sales-manager\",\"title\":\"HR RECRUITER/GENERALIST | Microcision\",\"desc\":null,\"og\":null,\"robots\":null,\"imgs\":[\"Microcision logo.png | 31e942_ef154a865afe4fa79723417987ebbaeb~mv2.png\"],\"form\":[],\"iframes\":[],\"sha256\":\"f0a666b001fffa39a58b99af2433049e0dca8271d5be706ce29a6bd7ce84eda4\",\"text\":\"Skip to Main Content\\n\\nHOME\\n\\nSERVICES\\n\\nABOUT\\n\\nEXPANSION\\n\\nCAREERS\\n\\nCONTACT\\n\\nHR RECRUITER/GENERALIST\\n\\nWe are seeking an experienced HR Recruiter to join our team and take full responsibility for end-to-end recruitment at Microcision, including sourcing and recruiting, screening/interviewing, and on-boarding employees to our organization. This is a part-time position requiring 16-20 hours per week.\\n\\n\\nAs our HR Recruiter, your primary responsibilities will be:\\n\\n\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a0Strategically partner with HR Manager to support full cycle recruiting initiatives, including talent sourcing, candidate evaluation and screening, interview process, offer negotiation, and hiring process.\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a0Create and manage all recruiting systems to attract and hire talent for all levels of the business.\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a0Identify diverse, top level talent within the organization\\u2019s primary markets through sourcing methods which include direct\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 sourcing, networking, job boards, referrals, on-line resources, professional associations and other avenues.\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a0Propose new approaches to recruitment strategies and execution\\n\\n\\nTo be considered for this position, you must have the following:\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a03-5 years of recruiting experience required\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a0Experience in a manufacturing environment a plus\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a0Solid knowledge of recruiting techniques and ability to build a consultative approach with hiring managers\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a0Strong oral and written communication skills\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a0Technically savvy - proficiency in MS Office Suite applications, HRIS databases, social media, applicant tracking systems\\n\\u2022 \\u00a0 \\u00a0Demonstrate leadership skills, customer service professionalism and ability to maintain active recruitment with minimum supervision\\n\\n\\nCompensation: $21.00-$25.00 per hour\\n\\n\\u00a9 2022\\u00a0by Microcision LLC\"}"
